silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_03_olog_node_arrow_law_yoneda_hom_leg a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "OlogNodeArrowLawYonedaHomLegExample" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_03_olog_node_arrow_law_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'OlogNodeArrowLawYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In 'Olog Node-or-Arrow Law', the type_gate_arrow witnesses the species-typing step that assigns DomesticCat / TSN 183798 to VetRecord_77, keeping species-type distinct from the individual.; also, In 'Olog Node-or-Arrow Law', the forbidden_shortcut_arrow is the dashed red arrow from TartuClinicIntakeForm to VetCarePlanPDF_77 that bypasses all four gates; it is admitted only when it is shown to be equal to the four-gate composite." .
